0 -14 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * zingsho-zingsho : day by day, every day) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: Complete nominal reduplication of zingsho \(day\).) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * kachut-kachut : step-by-step, very slowly) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: Manner adverb reduplication.) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * ngam-ngam : sweetly, pleasantly fragrant) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: Sensory expressive reduplication.) Tj
